## Known Gotchas

> Hard-won lessons the agent must respect. `/troubleshoot`, `/ip-find` and `/deploy-new` check this list.

- [e.g. NAS NIC at 10.0.20.30 is dead; always use 10.0.20.31]
- [e.g. After recreating an LXC, flush stale ARP on every node: `ip neigh flush dev vmbr0 <IP>`]

---

## Behavioral Rules

1. Follow the Change Documentation Protocol for every change
2. Check the Task Registry before starting work
3. Never read, print, or commit secrets. Skip the `Sensitive` doc entirely
4. Preserve existing content. Never delete documentation without asking
5. Ask before running anything destructive (`terraform destroy`, `qm destroy`, `rm -rf`)
6. Prefer documented facts over guesses. If docs and reality disagree, suggest `/doc-sync`
